# Typst Math Suite Sweep

## Accent

$$\grave{a}, \acute{b}, \hat{f}, \tilde{u}, \bar{a}, \bar{a}, \breve{a}, \dot{x}, \ddot{a}, \dddot{a}, \ddddot{a}, \mathring{a}, \H{a}, \check{x}, \vec{Z}, \vec{Z}, \vec{Z}, \vec{a}, \vec{a}$$

$$\hat{x + y}$$

## Attach

$$f_{x} + t^{b} + V_{1}^{2} + A_{\beta}^{\alpha}$$

$${{}_{8}^{16}O}_{2}^{2}$$

$${{}_{x}^{u}a_{b}^{t}}_{y}^{v}$$

$$\sum\limits_{1}^{2} + \sum\nolimits_{1}^{2}$$

## Fractions and roots

$$\frac{1}{2} + {x}/{y} + {x}/{y}$$

$$\binom{n}{k_{1}k_{2}k_{3}} + \sqrt{x} + \sqrt[3]{x}$$

## Delimiters

$$(x + y) + |x| + \Vert x\Vert  + \lfloor x\rfloor + \lceil x\rceil + \lfloor x\rceil$$

$$\to + |$$

## Matrix vector cases

$$\begin{pmatrix}1 & 2 \\ 3 & 4\end{pmatrix}$$

$$\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\ 3 & 4\end{bmatrix}$$

$$\begin{matrix}1 & 2 \\ 3 & 4\end{matrix}$$

$$\left(\begin{matrix}a \\ b \\ c\end{matrix}\right) + \left[\begin{matrix}1 \\ 2\end{matrix}\right]$$

$$\left\{\begin{array}{l}1 if x < 0 \\ 2 else\end{array}\right.$$

$$\left.\begin{array}{l}z_{n_{p}} \\ a^{2}\end{array}\right)$$

## Class operators and styles

$$x + \operatorname{lim}\limits_{n \to \infty} n$$

$$\textstyle \mathrm{A} + \textstyle \mathit{A} + \textstyle \mathbf{A} + \textstyle \mathrm{A} + \textstyle \mathsf{A}$$

$$\textstyle \mathcal{A} + \textstyle \mathscr{A} + \textstyle \mathfrak{A} + \textstyle \mathtt{A} + \textstyle \mathbb{A}$$

$$\displaystyle \sum_{i} x_{i} + \textstyle \sum_{i} x_{i} + \scriptstyle x + \scriptscriptstyle x$$

## Under over cancel align

$$\cancel{x} + \bcancel{x} + \xcancel{x}$$

$$\underbrace{x + y}_{n} + \overbrace{x + y}^{n}$$

$$\underbrace{x + y}_{n} + \overbrace{x + y}^{n}$$

$$\underline{x + y} + \overline{x + y}$$

$$\underbrace{x + y}_{n} + \overbrace{x + y}^{n}$$

$$\underset{n}{x + y} + \overset{n}{x + y}$$

$$a  = b  \\   = c$$
